        "q2": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I use the 3 products together?",
            "answer": "<p>First, use 1 pH test strip to check your vaginal pH level. Second, insert 1 Cookie Fresh Boric Acid Suppository vaginally each night at bedtime for 7 to 14 days to re-establish normal acidity. Third, take 1 Femina Probiotic Capsule orally every morning with water to maintain long-term internal microflora balance.</p>"
