          "settings": {
            "question": "How does micro-shielding work?",
            "answer": "<p>Our patented micro-encapsulation process creates a protective micro-shield around each bacterium (never the capsule shell alone). This ensures over 90% of live probiotic strains survive stomach acid and arrive safely in the gut to support intimate and digestive balance. Learn more on <a href=\"/pages/what-is-microencapsulation\">how Velobiotics micro-shielding works</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
